  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n ayd\u0131nl\u0131k b\xF6l\xFCmlerine daha yak\u0131n duran
    bir \"di\u015Fbudak a\u011Fac\u0131\" g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Zeytingiller familyas\u0131ndan
    olan ve sulak yerlerde yeti\u015Fen bu a\u011Fa\xE7, bedenindeki su kayb\u0131n\u0131n
    da bir i\u015Fareti {{isim}}. Telvelerin, g\xFCn boyu s\xFCren halsizlik ve yorgunluk
    \u015Fikayetlerinin bir\xE7o\u011Funun, yetersiz s\u0131v\u0131 al\u0131m\u0131na
    ba\u011Fl\u0131 oldu\u011Funu s\xF6yl\xFCyor. Su t\xFCketimini art\u0131rd\u0131\u011F\u0131nda,
    nedenini anlamad\u0131\u011F\u0131n pek \xE7ok s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131n\u0131n
    da ge\xE7ti\u011Fini g\xF6receksin. Unutma; g\xFCnde 10 bardak yani 1.5-2 litrenin
    \xFCzerine \xE7\u0131kmal\u0131s\u0131n!"
